The previous draft failed its evidence or scope check. Write the entire corrected answer. Remove unsupported
claims and unrelated material, and keep the answer that the retrieved evidence can support.
Repair only the reported issues. {% if brief_section %}Include a discussion of evidence gaps only when explicitly assigned and supported by citations.{% else %}If a requested measure is unavailable, state the limit of the reviewed evidence.{% endif %}
