Keep the sentence with the citation that supports it, or remove the whole claim if no passage supports it.
If the opening lacks support, look for a retrieved passage that supports it. If none does, start with a different
finding that the retrieved evidence supports. Keep the requested writing voice and length when revising.
Reuse the supported findings and do not add examples unrelated to this assignment.
